+            // Papo start - scan box as one AABB (3 allocs -> 1): the moveByPositionAndProgress ->
+            // getMovementArea -> minmax chain only feeds this getEntities call. With m = bounds moved by
+            // the pos+progress offset and d' = delta*axisStep, the union collapses per axis to
+            // lo = min(m.edge + min(d',0), m.min) / hi = max(m.edge + max(d',0), m.max) on the movement
+            // axis (edge = min for negative dirs, max for positive) and plain m.min/m.max elsewhere.
+            // FP op order matches the chain exactly (left-associative adds, same Math.min/max operand
+            // order) and the ctor normalization is the identity in both forms (union always normalized).
+            List<Entity> entities = level.getEntities(null, papoMovementUnionBox(pos, collisionShape.bounds(), piston, movementDirection, d));
